  step=2,dige:020dc4c31cfd085d
    Assertion:every-identity-is-born,sentence:every identity is born a crew of one — its key is a particle on /Crew not a runtime field — it wields its own key until a ledger says otherwise
  step=3,dige:b1fdb8c5aaed275a
    Assertion:the-division-is-a,sentence:the division is a ledger — the Captain writes a row and a cert and the device takes the whole ledger — it is a Cave by its row — it holds the soul secret and still signs as itself
    Assertion:the-roster-routes-both,sentence:the roster routes both bodies at their own names — the Charter verifies against the soul — and the two ledgers read byte for byte the same
  step=4,dige:34756ed9a836b4a6
    Assertion:the-ledger-fails-closed,sentence:the ledger fails closed — a stranger-signed ledger and a tampered one change nothing — a forged ejection riding a real ledger is dropped and the Cave stays crew
  step=5,dige:cca7c2d23e3a680d
    Assertion:the-account-ferries-over,sentence:the account ferries over the sealed pier — once a MyCave pier stands the soul exports and seals its whole account with the fragment code — the device folds it into its own identity with the soul secret HELD not wielded — a wrong code lands nothing
